{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ComputationalHorizon","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.numLeaves_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.numLeaves_pos","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L62-L66","doc":"The leaf count is a power of three, hence positive: the resolution tree is\nnever empty. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.minTime_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.minTime_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L51-L60","doc":"The saturation time is non-negative (it is `0` only in the degenerate\n`c = 0` case). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.minTime_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.minTime_eq","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Bandwidth-saturation bound: `t ≥ (c·log 3 / 𝔅(q))·3^{c−c₀}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.minTime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.minTime","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Minimum Planck-step time to extract the degree-0 answer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c0","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Reference crossing count `c₀` in the exponent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.bandwidth_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.bandwidth_pos","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Bandwidth is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.bandwidth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.bandwidth","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Information bandwidth `𝔅(q)` per Planck time. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.numLeaves_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.numLeaves_eq","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The resolution tree has `3^c` leaves — one per discrete history. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.numLeaves","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.numLeaves","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Number of leaves of the Skein resolution tree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c_eq","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L32-L32","doc":"`c = 3N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.c","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Number of crossings `c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.N","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Number of Toffoli gates `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComputationalHorizon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComputationalHorizon","kind":"structure","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ComputationalHorizon.lean#L20-L47","doc":"Data for a computational horizon of `L = β̂`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: `N` Toffoli gates give `c = 3N` crossings; the\nresolution tree has `numLeaves = 3^c` leaves; the information bandwidth\n`bandwidth = 𝔅(q) > 0` bounds the sampling rate; and `minTime` is pinned\nto the bandwidth-saturation lower bound. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:computational-horizon","label":"def:computational-horizon","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/computational-horizon.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}